           ┌───────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────┐
           ▼                                                       ▼
[ Approved for Branch Merge ]                           [ Sandbox Quarantine ]
           │                                                       │
           ▼                                                       ▼
[ Automated Execution ]                                 [ Administrative Review ]
- Frame Interpolation (FILM)                             - Log Diagnostics
- Keyframe Render (DiT)                                  - Trigger Self-Healing Search
- Memory Optimization (bitsandbytes)
4. Agentic Curation Execution Plan
Semantic Discovery: Agents scan Hugging Face model cards for tags (video-generation, frame-interpolation, diffusers).
Snapshotting: High-performing models are snapshotted into an immutable local cache/registry.
OPA Validation: The OPA engine runs opa eval on the resource payload.
Pipeline Trigger: Upon successful verification, the CI pipeline initializes frame rendering, dynamically upscaling framerates and stabilizing storyboards.
Self-Healing Loop: If a model fails performance profiling, the agent falls back to the next highest-rated verified alternative in the curated list.
